  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/Entity_Model_Features/blob/master/src/main/resources/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"150\"><br></p>\n<h1>实体模型特性</h1>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252frURmwrzUcz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vU8pcbf.png\" alt=\"discord\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yZzzW4Q.pngg\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-model-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rpoyjVG.png\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VgKekoJ.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentity-model-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7fioiRx.png\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tiNmDIH.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/Entity_Model_Features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EYNx6oL.png\" alt=\"github\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yar5K6v.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ftraben\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xdhWKwC.png\" alt=\"kofi\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/4I1XuqiY/images/49f5b98dfef5b073a3971750673d343e1f92efe5.png\" width=\"550\"><br></p>\n<hr>\n<h1>关于</h1>\n<p>Entity Model Features (EMF) 是一款适用于 Fabric、Forge 和 NeoForge 的模组，为 OptiFine 的自定义实体模型（CEM）提供支持。</p>\n<p>专为希望使用 CEM 资源包功能，同时又能使用 Sodium、Continuity 或 ETF 等 OptiFine 替代模组的玩家设计。</p>\n<h1>必要模组</h1>\n<p>如果条件允许，请同时安装以下模组（Sodium 等显而易见的依赖未在此列出）。</p>\n<p>此外，EMF 与 dorianpb 的 CEM 以及 OptiFine / OptiFabric 不兼容，这一点无需多言。</p>\n<h4>必需</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentitytexturefeatures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Entity Texture Features (ETF)</a>：EMF 使用了本人另一款模组 ETF 的若干功能，因此为必装项。（主要用于支持随机模型功能、配置界面，并允许模型中设置的纹理像 OptiFine 一样动态变化）</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>强烈推荐</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentityculling\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Entity Culling</a>：该模组在减少实体渲染延迟方面效果显著，甚至优于 Sodium 自带的实体剔除功能。在使用如 Fresh Animations 等高动画负载资源包时，此模组非常有益。</li>\n</ul>\n<h1>Fresh Animations？</h1>\n<p>是的。</p>\n<p>可以正常运行 :)</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/4I1XuqiY/images/2f32dbeadc25e46ef6c56f0e47e5eb5d305c8ea2.png\" width=\"450\"><br></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252ffresh-animations-v1-0%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">下载 Fresh Animations</a></p>\n<h1>功能特性、OptiFine 差异及已知问题</h1>\n<p>最新功能详情页面：<a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/Entity_Model_Features/blob/master/FEATURES.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">功能特性与 OptiFine 差异对照</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h1>更新日志</h1>\n<p>您可以在<a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/Entity_Model_Features/blob/master/changelog.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>查看更新日志。</p>\n<hr>\n<h1>需要帮助或有疑问？</h1>\n<p>您可以通过我的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252frURmwrzUcz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a>（<em>推荐</em>）联系，或在 <a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/Entity_Model_Features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 上提交 Issue。</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252frURmwrzUcz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vU8pcbf.png\" alt=\"discord\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yZzzW4Q.pngg\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-model-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rpoyjVG.png\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VgKekoJ.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentity-model-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7fioiRx.png\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tiNmDIH.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/Entity_Model_Features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EYNx6oL.png\" alt=\"github\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yar5K6v.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ftraben\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xdhWKwC.png\" alt=\"kofi\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>主机合作伙伴优惠</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.kinetichosting.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d641\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/BVzZfTc1/images/bfb592538f8206a6a2d72d19c90714bea91b0e07.png\" alt=\"image\"></a></p>",
